            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "KitchenWitch"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Not what I expected from a lace cookie. The batter was very stiff... and the cookies came out very thick. Crunchy, not thin and crispy. I tried to flatten them out as much as I could, to no avail. A little less flour might help? I wouldn't wait an entire minute before shaping, they harden fast.",
